    "updated_at": "2017-03-02T20:27:45Z",
    "body": "This LGTM! I forgot to ask though, we are trying to get web platform tests before merging any changes. I'm happy to help with that if you want, just let me know. Mostly it will be a matter of:\r\n\r\n- deleting html/editing/dnd/the-dropzone-attribute/\r\n- Removing any other tests that depend on dropzone; https://github.com/w3c/web-platform-tests/search?p=7&q=dropzone&utf8=%E2%9C%93 shows a few\r\n- Adding a line to https://github.com/w3c/web-platform-tests/blob/master/html/dom/elements/elements-in-the-dom/historical.html",
